            "review_title": "Review at Lo Say Coffee Store",
            "review_text": "Rohit Nigade\n3 contributions\n1\nTHE BEST CAFE IN DA LAT!\nJun 2019 • Friends\nWe were a group of three wandering around Da Lat and discovered this cafe whilst roaming on an isolated road. I was awestruck seeing the view from this cafe. Not just the view, the cafe has been designed wonderfully. Simple yet AMAZING! Also don't forget to take your camera along, you're going to end up clicking tons of photos. Despite of all this, the prices are quite reasonable! Also the owner and staff are amiable and courteous.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 7, 2019",
